==German==

===Etymology===
From northern {{inh|de|gmh|rūpe}}, from {{der|de|gml|rūpe}}, itself perhaps from {{der|de|gem-pro|*rūpō}} and then probably related with {{m|gem-pro|*raupijaną}}, whence  {{m+|de|raufen|t=to pluck, pick, harvest}}. Cognate with {{cog|dum|rupe}}, whence dialectal {{cog|nl|ruip}}. Also related with standard {{m+|nl|rups}}.

